      ('Mauritius Imposes Curfew After Unrest Over Police Shooting of a Young Woman', '• Reuters wire copy carried by Al Jazeera; thin source, written as a brief.
• Source does not say how long the curfew will remain in force or name the charged sergeant.
• Sequence is unclear: the PM''s office said the situation had returned to normal, yet a curfew was announced the same day.
• Source says Thomas was wounded ''in the south of the country''s capital'' - rendered as the southern part of the capital; verify.
• Source (Al Jazeera): https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/13/mauritius-imposes-curfew-after-night-of-unrest-over-police-shooting?traffic_source=rss
