• Rewritten from published reporting with attribution. Verify facts against the original before major edits.'),
      ('Egyptian Journalists Plan Cairo Protest Over Detention of Six Fact-Checkers', '• Source published Friday, Oct. 9; ''Sunday'' and ''Wednesday'' refer to Oct. 4 and Oct. 7 but were left as weekdays, and the protest date was not specified.
• Torture allegations come from the detainees via their lawyers; police and the Interior Ministry deny them, and the prosecution cites forensic exams finding no injuries.
• Story is several days old; check whether the weekend protest took place before publishing.
