• Rewritten from published reporting with attribution. Verify facts against the original before major edits.'),
      ('Navi Pillay Wins Nobel Peace Prize for Strengthening International Law', '• Announcement was Friday, Oct. 9; story is several days old relative to this batch.
• Genocide finding is the U.N. commission''s conclusion; Israel rejects it and called the commission biased - attributed throughout.
