      ('U.S. and Japan Hold Second Indo-Pacific Dialogue in Tokyo on Aid and Security', '• U.S. government readout (Office of the Spokesman); no Japanese readout or independent reporting used - written as a brief.
• Japanese names kept in the release''s family-name-first order (Namazu Hiroyuki, Takaichi Sanae).
• Release refers to ''the DPRK''; rendered as North Korea. No specific deliverables, figures or dates for projects were given.
• Source (U.S. Department of State): https://www.state.gov/releases/office-of-the-spokesman/2026/10/second-u-s-japan-free-and-open-indo-pacific-foip-dialogue/
