      ('Saudi Engineer Charged With Planting Recording Device in OpenAI Office', '• All accusations come from the federal complaint, prosecutors and the FBI as reported by the BBC; Alfozan has only been charged, and no plea, lawyer or response is reported.
• Source does not specify which federal court or whether he was detained or released after his appearance.
• OpenAI''s account of using its own AI models to identify the employee is the company''s claim.
